{"unit_id":"sopreigj__dsh-project-forge#feature-5","repo":"sopreigj/dsh-project-forge","commit":"d95eb89157e398da1b20bde0db5506d1bd5d7b4e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Project Forge 的功能「本地 Git 守卫」：检查 shell 命令并限制推送、远端变更及破坏本地历史的操作，默认保持仓库本地。","source":"generated","evidence":["plugin/guards/register.js:60-110","plugin/guards/command.js:1-90"]}
